From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 05:04:36 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Add plain-language guides to all pages

- New css/plain.css: "In plain words" box with an everyday comparison,
  a short demo guide and a glossary of terms.
- Each algorithm page explains its question in everyday language first.
- Algorithms overview lists the six questions, each linked to its page.
- About, Dashboard and Contact get a short plain-language introduction.
- Fix unbalanced markup in the Naive Bayes demo buttons.
- Demo steps use the exact control labels on each page.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011R9w2nkswYGc5P1TkM11Vo
